WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Sit sideways against a wall, then swing the legs up as you lie back.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Scoot the hips close to the wall, legs resting up.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Let the arms rest open at your sides, palms up.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Close the eyes and breathe softly.
